Rule 3 (out tensor has the same dtype as input tensor, if out is provided)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_2 ≠ false then dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor must have at least one element)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (If out is provided, it should not be aliased with input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_2 ≠ false then v_1 ≠ v_2
>>
